sequenceDiagram
    participant K as kiko route
    participant L as litellm
    participant W as LoggingWorker
    participant S as KikoSQLiteLogger
    participant DB as SQLite
    K->>L: acompletion(…)
    L-->>K: response
    L--)W: enqueue success_event (async task)
    W->>S: async_log_success_event
    S->>DB: INSERT (model, tokens, cost_usd, route, ts)
    Note over K,DB: stream: billing fires after iterator exhausted
